@sprint2 @signing @letters
Feature: [Sprint 2] Pengesahan Surat dengan PIN Keamanan dan Nomor Surat Unik
  As a Ketua RT
  I want to sign letters digitally using a secret PIN that issues a unique letter number and an official PDF
  So that only I can legalise letters and every letter can be traced by its number

  Background:
    Given the RTConnect backend application is ready
    And the resident "resident@example.test" and the RT head "rt@example.test" are logged in with password "LocalTestOnly#2026"
    And the resident has a new "DOM" application with "digital" signature

  Scenario: Tanda tangan digital dengan PIN benar menerbitkan nomor surat dan PDF
    When the RT head signs the application with PIN "123456"
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response JSON should indicate success
    And the response field "data.status" should be "selesai"
    And the response field "data.nomor_surat_resmi" should match pattern "^[0-9]+/[0-9]+/[A-Z]+/DOM/[0-9]{3,}/[IVXLC]+/[0-9]{4}$"
    And the application status in the database should be "selesai"

  Scenario: Warga mengunduh PDF surat resmi yang sudah disahkan
    Given the application has been signed digitally with PIN "123456"
    When the resident downloads the letter PDF
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response content type should be "application/pdf"
    And the downloaded file should be a valid PDF

  Scenario: Nomor surat selalu unik dan berurutan
    Given the application has been signed digitally with PIN "123456"
    When the RT head signs a second new "DOM" application with PIN "123456"
    Then the two official letter numbers should be different and sequential

  Scenario: PIN salah ditolak dan sisa percobaan berkurang
    When the RT head enters the wrong PIN "999999" 1 times
    Then the response status code should be 401
    And the response field "error" should be "INVALID_PIN"
    And the response field "data.sisa_percobaan" should be "4"
    And the application status in the database should be "diajukan"

  Scenario: PIN dikunci setelah 5 kali salah berturut-turut
    When the RT head enters the wrong PIN "999999" 5 times
    Then the response status code should be 429
    And the response field "error" should be "PIN_LOCKED"
    And the application status in the database should be "diajukan"

  Scenario: PIN yang bukan 6 digit angka ditolak
    When the RT head signs the application with PIN "12ab"
    Then the response status code should be 400
    And the response field "error" should be "VALIDATION_ERROR"

  Scenario: Surat yang sudah selesai tidak dapat disahkan ulang
    Given the application has been signed digitally with PIN "123456"
    When the RT head signs the application with PIN "123456"
    Then the response status code should be 409
    And the response field "error" should be "INVALID_STATUS"

  Scenario: PDF belum tersedia sebelum surat disahkan
    When the resident downloads the letter PDF
    Then the response status code should be 404
    And the response JSON should indicate failure

  Scenario: Ketua RT mengonfirmasi surat bertanda tangan basah siap diambil
    Given the resident has a new "KTP" application with "basah" signature
    When the RT head confirms the physical signature
    Then the response status code should be 200
    And the response field "data.status" should be "siap_diambil"
    And the application status in the database should be "siap_diambil"
